Boost.Serialization's Jamfile builds codecvt_null.cpp into both serialization and wserialization, which links
serialization: two archives defining codecvt_null<wchar_t>, an overlap in one image (otok-toml.md 4.5). Boost's CMake
builds it into serialization alone; so does b2 with this.

diff --git a/libs/serialization/build/Jamfile.v2 b/libs/serialization/build/Jamfile.v2
index 50fcce7..80cbb53 100644
--- a/libs/serialization/build/Jamfile.v2
+++ b/libs/serialization/build/Jamfile.v2
@@ -117,7 +117,6 @@ WSOURCES =
     xml_woarchive
     polymorphic_xml_wiarchive
     polymorphic_xml_woarchive
-    codecvt_null
 ;
 
 lib boost_serialization
